base64 (the Meadow package) is a port of the Rust crate base64
(https://github.com/marshallpierce/rust-base64), version 0.22.1, by Marshall
Pierce and contributors, to Meadow. Its test cases are generated from that
crate, and its code is translated from the crate's source.

